{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "134", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So 196 is the target needed for Bangladesh to keep the 3-match series alive. Can they do that and stun the world? Or will the Kiwis pocket the series tonight itself? Hopefully, we get some entertainment. Stay tuned for the run chase.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "133", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Spare a thought for the Bangladeshi bowlers. One man stood between them and a decent bowling display. Mortaza and Rubel started off well but could not keep Munro quiet. They came back well towards the end, once Munro got out, thanks to Mustafizur and Shakib, bowling yorkers at the death. Rubel ended with 3 wickets overall.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "132", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "It was all about Colin Munro today. After being asked to bat, the home side was reduced to 46/3 but Munro played a stunning knock, reaching his maiden T20I century, of just 52 balls. He took the visitors apart who simply had no answer to his exploits. He received good support from Tom Bruce, who got a half century of his own. The duo shared a stand worth 123 in just 67 balls, 72 of which were scored by Munro. The rest did not contribute much but then, one good innings is enough in a T20.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "131", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "NEW ZEALAND HAVE FINISHED ON 195/7. That is a very, very good total but what a fine comeback from Bangladesh. At the 15-over mark, they were staring at a target in excess of 200, even 220 perhaps but they conceded just 42 runs in the last 5 overs, picking up 4 wickets as well, to restrict the Kiwis under 200.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.6", "Id": "130", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4371", "Batsman": "65344", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.5", "Id": "129", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4371", "Batsman": "57903", "Commentary": "OUT run out (Rubel Hossain). New Zealand have lost their seventh wicket.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "57903", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.4", "Id": "128", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4371", "Batsman": "57903", "Commentary": "2 runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.3", "Id": "127", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4371", "Batsman": "57903", "Commentary": "No run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.2", "Id": "126", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4371", "Batsman": "57903", "Commentary": "2 runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.1", "Id": "125", "UID": null, "OID": nul