: "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Toss - Bangladesh have won the toss and elected to field. They are unchanged from last match. New Zealand on the other hand have made three changes - Neil Broom, Matt Henry and Lockie Ferguson make way for Jimmy Neesham, Ish Sodhi and Trent Boult.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Hello and a warm welcome everyone for the second T20I between New Zealand and Bangladesh at Bay Oval, Mount Maunganui. The visiting team is still struggling on this tour and after getting blanked in the ODIs, they faced a loss in the first T20I as well. It's a do-or-die game for them today and we are expecting a better fight. New Zealand, on the other hand, fared nicely in the last game and seems to be going from strength to strength. Promises to be a good game.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 134, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:13:32 AM"}}}